    accTitle: How a benchmark in this repository runs
    accDescr: Public documents are pinned by hash or commit. A pipeline pinned to exact versions processes them. Frozen questions with expected answers are scored exactly, and results are saved next to the code so every figure can be checked without rerunning.
    D["Public documents<br>pinned by hash or commit"] --> P["Pipeline at pinned versions<br>setup.sh, run.sh"]
    Q["Frozen questions<br>and expected answers"] --> S["Exact scoring<br>no model as judge"]
    P --> S
    S --> R["results/ saved in the repo<br>with denominators"]
